WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Personal vault overview. All data is fictional.

00:02.000 --> 00:05.200
Open Accounts, then the Current account ledger.

00:05.200 --> 00:07.600
Press z to inspect sort choices. Escape returns to the ledger.

00:07.600 --> 00:11.200
Open an entry to inspect its bank and expense postings.

00:11.200 --> 00:15.200
Open Reports. Press c to group expenses by class.

00:15.200 --> 00:19.500
Return to Overview. Press e to switch to the company vault.

00:19.500 --> 00:22.500
Return to the personal vault. Each entity keeps separate books.
